{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1167","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Scalar Queries"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$. All $$$a_i$$$ are pairwise distinct."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's define function $$$f(l, r)$$$ as follows: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" let's define array $$$b_1, b_2, \\dots, b_{r - l + 1}$$$, where $$$b_i = a_{l - 1 + i}$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" sort array $$$b$$$ in increasing order; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" result of the function $$$f(l, r)$$$ is $$$\\sum\\limits_{i = 1}^{r - l + 1}{b_i \\cdot i}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Calculate $$$\\left(\\sum\\limits_{1 \\le l \\le r \\le n}{f(l, r)}\\right) \\mod (10^9+7)$$$, i.e. total sum of $$$f$$$ for all subsegments of $$$a$$$ modulo $$$10^9+7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 5 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$$$, $$$a_i \\neq a_j$$$ for $$$i \\neq j$$$) — array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer — the total sum of $$$f$$$ for all subsegments of $$$a$$$ modulo $$$10^9+7$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n5 2 4 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n167\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n123456789 214365879 987654321\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n582491518\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Description of the first example: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 1) = 5 \\cdot 1 = 5$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 2) = 2 \\cdot 1 + 5 \\cdot 2 = 12$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 3) = 2 \\cdot 1 + 4 \\cdot 2 + 5 \\cdot 3 = 25$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 4) = 2 \\cdot 1 + 4 \\cdot 2 + 5 \\cdot 3 + 7 \\cdot 4 = 53$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2, 2) = 2 \\cdot 1 = 2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2, 3) = 2 \\cdot 1 + 4 \\cdot 2 = 10$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2, 4) = 2 \\cdot 1 + 4 \\cdot 2 + 7 \\cdot 3 = 31$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(3, 3) = 4 \\cdot 1 = 4$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(3, 4) = 4 \\cdot 1 + 7 \\cdot 2 = 18$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(4, 4) = 7 \\cdot 1 = 7$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1167F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1167/problem/F"}